</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.6</h2><ul><li><strong>Settings groups a control with the choices that belong to it.</strong> In Settings, a child row hides while its switch is off, and Notifications shows the countdown hours, starting at 6. A separate notice before the reset stays off until it is turned on. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/66">#66</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.6">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
